\f(CRtop_padding\fP, \f(CRbottom_padding\fP, \f(CRleft_padding\fP, \f(CRright_padding\fP, \f(CRwindow_gap\fP: mathematical integer \f(CRINT_MIN...INT_MAX\fP;
