.sp
The display \f(CRframe\fP is the full display bounds. The \f(CRvisible\-frame\fP excludes the system menu bar or notch and the Dock, matching \f(CRNSScreen.visibleFrame\fP; it does not exclude yabai\(cqs configured external bar.
.sp
